/**
 * Desktop global keyboard shortcuts and pane focus management:
 * cmd/ctrl + T (toggle sidebar), W (cycle left panes), K/J (cycle all panes),
 * N (new note), Backspace (delete), +/-/0 (editor font size), shift+L (lock).
